        <a href="../contact/" class="nav-link" style="color:#3a3d35">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <a href="tel:4064051700" class="btn-green" style="background:#1f4a2b;color:#fdfbf7;font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 1px 0 #0d2415">Call (406) 405-1700</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2ddd0;background:#f6f2e8">
      <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:44px">
        <p style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#a9741f;margin-bottom:18px">WHO WE ARE</p>
        <h1 style="font-size:52px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.028em;color:#14331d;max-width:22ch;text-wrap:balance">A veteran-owned builder in the Flathead Valley</h1>
        <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4d43;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:20px;max-width:64ch">Locally owned, third-generation craftsmanship, and a crew small enough that you'll know everyone who walks through your door.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:80px">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:44px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#14331d;text-wrap:balance">Small on purpose</h2>
          <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4d43;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:20px">Kalkman Construction is a locally owned, veteran-owned residential construction company based in Whitefish, Montana. We were built on over 15 years of hands-on work in the trades and a craft that's been passed down three generations.</p>
          <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4d43;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:16px">We keep the operation small deliberately. The person who walks your project and prices it is the person you'll see on site — not a salesperson who hands you off to a project manager you've never met. That's the single biggest difference between working with us and working with a larger outfit.</p>
          <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4d43;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:16px">It also means we take on fewer jobs at once. When we're on your project, we're on your project.</p>

          <h2 style="font-size:44px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#14331d;text-wrap:balance;margin-top:52px">How we work</h2>
          <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4d43;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:20px">Every project starts with listening. Before we talk materials or budget, we want to understand how you actually use the space, what's frustrating about it now, and what you want it to become. A lot of what we do is telling people honestly what will and won't work — including when the thing they're asking for isn't the thing that will fix the problem.</p>
          <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4d43;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:16px">From there you get a written scope with real numbers: what's included, what isn't, what the schedule looks like, and where the risks are. Then we build it, keep the site clean, and tell you what's happening next.</p>
          <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4d43;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:16px">We answer the phone. That sounds like a low bar, and in this industry it isn't.</p>

          <h2 style="font-size:44px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#14331d;text-wrap:balance;margin-top:52px">Credentials</h2>
          <div style="display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:24px">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:baseline;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e3d6"><span style="color:#a9741f;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0">01</span><div><span style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#14331d">Veteran owned and operated</span><p style="font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a4d43;margin-top:5px">Built on accountability, discipline, and pride in the work.</p></div></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:baseline;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e3d6"><span style="color:#a9741f;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0">02</span><div><span style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#14331d">Over 15 years in the trades</span><p style="font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a4d43;margin-top:5px">Hands-on experience across framing, finish, and full project management.</p></div></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:baseline;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e3d6"><span style="color:#a9741f;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0">03</span><div><span style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#14331d">Third-generation craftsmanship</span><p style="font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a4d43;margin-top:5px">A family trade, carried forward rather than picked up.</p></div></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:baseline;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e3d6"><span style="color:#a9741f;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0">04</span><div><span style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#14331d">Licensed, bonded, and insured</span><p style="font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a4d43;margin-top:5px">For residential construction work in Montana. Certificates on request.</p></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="sticky" style="position:sticky;top:110px;display:grid;gap:12px">
          <img src="../assets/vaulted-cedar-ceiling-remodel-whitefish-mt.jpeg" alt="Vaulted cedar ceiling remodel by Kalkman Construction" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover">
          <div style="background:#f6f2e8;border:1px solid #e2ddd0;padding:28px">
            <p style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#a9741f">HOMEOWNER FEEDBACK</p>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:3px;margin-top:14px;color:#e5b25c;font-size:17px">★★★★★</div>
            <p style="font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#26291f;margin-top:14px">“Great experience with Kalkman Construction. Jake &amp; Jim did a floor install and some other projects for me at my place, did a great job. Great communication, and easy to work with.”</p>
            <p style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;color:#14331d;margin-top:18px">Ethan Taft <span style="font-weight:500;color:#6b6e62">· Google Review</span></p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="wrap" style="padding-bottom:96px">
