        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:32px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Let&#x27;s talk about your project.</h2>
          <p style="font-size:18px;color:#c3c8b6;margin-top:10px">You&#x27;ll get a builder on the phone, not a call center.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="tel:4064051700" class="btn-gold" style="background:#e5b25c;color:#14331d;font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;padding:17px 30px;border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0">Call (406) 405-1700</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <section id="contact" style="background:#f6f2e8;border-top:1px solid #e2ddd0">
    <div class="wrap two" style="padding-top:88px;padding-bottom:88px">
      <div>
        <p style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#a9741f;margin-bottom:18px">LET'S TALK ABOUT YOUR HOME</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:44px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#14331d;text-wrap:balance">Tell us what you&#x27;re planning</h2>
        <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4d43;margin-top:20px;text-wrap:pretty">Call and you&#x27;ll get a builder, not a call center. Or send the form and we&#x27;ll follow up within one business day.</p>
        <div style="display:grid;gap:20px;margin-top:36px">
          <div style="border-top:1px solid #ded8c9;padding-top:18px">
            <p style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.16em;color:#6b6e62">PHONE</p>
            <a href="tel:4064051700" style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:27px;font-weight:800;color:#14331d;letter-spacing:-0.02em">(406) 405-1700</a>
          </div>
          <div style="border-top:1px solid #ded8c9;padding-top:18px">
            <p style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.16em;color:#6b6e62">SERVICE AREA</p>
            <p style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#14331d;margin-top:4px">Whitefish, MT &amp; the Flathead Valley</p>
          </div>
          <div style="border-top:1px solid #ded8c9;padding-top:18px">
            <p style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.16em;color:#6b6e62">HOURS</p>
            <p style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#14331d;margin-top:4px">Mon–Fri 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM</p>
            <p style="font-size:16.5px;color:#6b6e62">Sat–Sun closed</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div id="form-success" style="display:none;background:#fdfbf7;border:1px solid #e2ddd0;padding:36px">
          <h3 style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#14331d">Thanks — we got your details.</h3>
          <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4d43;margin-top:12px">We'll follow up within one business day. If it's time-sensitive, call <a href="tel:4064051700" style="font-weight:600">(406) 405-1700</a> and you'll get a builder on the line.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xbdnpwdv" method="POST" style="background:#fdfbf7;border:1px solid #e2ddd0;padding:36px">
          <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New website lead — Kalkman Construction">
          <h3 style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#14331d">Request project information</h3>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:22px">
            <label style="display:grid;gap:6px;font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#3a3d35;letter-spacing:0.03em;min-width:0">FIRST NAME
              <input type="text" name="First Name" required style="font-family:'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;font-size:16.5px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ded8c9;background:#fdfbf7;border-radius:2px;color:#1b1c19;width:100%;min-width:0">
            </label>
            <label style="display:grid;gap:6px;font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#3a3d35;letter-spacing:0.03em;min-width:0">LAST NAME
              <input type="text" name="Last Name" style="font-family:'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;font-size:16.5px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ded8c9;background:#fdfbf7;border-radius:2px;color:#1b1c19;width:100%;min-width:0">
            </label>
            <label style="display:grid;gap:6px;font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#3a3d35;letter-spacing:0.03em;min-width:0">PHONE
              <input type="tel" name="Phone" style="font-family:'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;font-size:16.5px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ded8c9;background:#fdfbf7;border-radius:2px;color:#1b1c19;width:100%;min-width:0">
            </label>
            <label style="display:grid;gap:6px;font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#3a3d35;letter-spacing:0.03em;min-width:0">EMAIL
              <input type="email" name="email" required style="font-family:'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;font-size:16.5px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ded8c9;background:#fdfbf7;border-radius:2px;color:#1b1c19;width:100%;min-width:0">
            </label>
            <label style="display:grid;gap:6px;font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#3a3d35;letter-spacing:0.03em;min-width:0;grid-column:span 2">SERVICE NEEDED
              <select name="Service Needed" style="font-family:'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;font-size:16.5px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ded8c9;background:#fdfbf7;border-radius:2px;color:#1b1c19;width:100%;min-width:0">
              <option>Kitchen Remodeling</option>
              <option>Bathroom Remodeling</option>
              <option>Whole Home Remodeling</option>
              <option>New Home Construction</option>
              <option>Home Additions</option>
              <option>Deck Construction &amp; Repairs</option>
              <option>Custom Cabinetry &amp; Built-ins</option>
